const head=(t,l)=>`<section class="w" style="padding:48px 20px 8px"><h1>${t}</h1>${l?`<p class="lead mute">${l}</p>`:''}</section>`;
/* Regular meeting night/time worked out from the published calendar (never typed in by hand).
   Looks at each section's own timed events, groups them by weekday + start + end, and reports the
   pattern(s) that repeat on at least three different dates. Camps, one-offs and all-day events are ignored. */
function meetingPatterns(k){
 const groups=new Map();
 E.forEach(e=>{
  if(e[1]!==k||!e[3])return;
  const wd=fd(e[0]).x.getDay(),key=wd+'|'+e[3]+'|'+(e[5]||'');
  if(e[5]&&((+e[5].slice(0,2)*60+ +e[5].slice(3))-(+e[3].slice(0,2)*60+ +e[3].slice(3)))>5*60)return;
  const g=groups.get(key)||{wd,s:e[3],e:e[5]||'',dates:new Set()};g.dates.add(e[0]);groups.set(key,g);
 });
 const list=[...groups.values()].filter(g=>g.dates.size>=3).sort((a,b)=>b.dates.size-a.dates.size);
 if(!list.length)return[];
 return list.filter(g=>g.dates.size>=Math.ceil(list[0].dates.size/2)).slice(0,2);
}
function meetsText(k){
 if(CFG.meetingTimes&&CFG.meetingTimes[k])return escapeHTML(CFG.meetingTimes[k]);
 if(calendarState==='loading')return'Check confirmed events';
 const p=meetingPatterns(k);
 if(!p.length)return calendarState==='error'||calendarState==='not-configured'?'See the calendar for meeting times':'See confirmed events below';
 return p.map(g=>D[g.wd]+'s, '+rng(g.s,g.e)).join('<br>');
}
const sectionCardMeetingInfo=k=>{const regular=CFG.meetingTimes&&CFG.meetingTimes[k];const patterns=meetingPatterns(k);return regular?'Meets '+escapeHTML(regular):patterns.length?'Meets '+patterns.map(g=>D[g.wd]+'s<br>'+rng(g.s,g.e)).join('<br>'):calendarState==='loading'?'Check confirmed events':calendarState==='error'||calendarState==='not-configured'?'See calendar for meeting times':'See confirmed events below'};
const secCard=k=>`<a class="card sc" style="--c:${S[k].c}" href="#${k}"><img src="${A[k].em}" alt=""><h3>${S[k].n}</h3><small>Ages ${S[k].age}</small><p class="meets" data-meeting-summary="${k}">${sectionCardMeetingInfo(k)}</p></a>`;
const join=`<section class="band" style="padding:44px 0 52px"><div class="w"><h2>Come and try Scouts, free for three weeks</h2><p class="lead">No uniform needed. Contact us before your first visit and we’ll confirm the right night.</p><a class="btn w2" href="/join/">How to visit</a><a class="btn ow" href="/contact/">Contact form</a></div></section>`;
const contactBox=k=>`<div class="card"><h3>Contact ${k?S[k].n:'us'}</h3><p>${CFG.hall}<br>${CFG.addr}</p><p><a href="mailto:${CFG.email}">${CFG.email}</a></p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Send an enquiry</a><a class="btn o" href="${maps}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions</a></div>`;
const stp=a=>`<ol class="steps">${a.map(x=>`<li><h3>${x[0]}</h3><p>${x[1]}</p></li>`).join('')}</ol>`;
const newsList=n=>posts.length?[...posts].sort((a,b)=>String(b[1]).localeCompare(String(a[1]))).slice(0,n).map(p=>`<article class="ev"><div class="dt"><b>${fd(p[1]).d}</b><span>${fd(p[1]).m}</span></div><div><h3><a href="/article/?slug=${encodeURIComponent(p[5]||slugify(p[0]))}">${escapeHTML(p[0])}</a></h3><p class="mute">${escapeHTML(p[2]||'News')} · ${escapeHTML(p[3].slice(0,180))}${p[3].length>180?'…':''}</p></div></article>`).join(''):newsState==='loading'?eventSkeletonHTML(Math.min(n,3),'Loading latest news'):newsState==='error'?'<p class="mute">News could not be loaded just now. Please try again shortly.</p>':'<p class="mute">No news has been published yet. Approved community stories will appear here.</p>';
const LINKS=[['Venturer Scouts WA','State-wide Venturer news, events and the Venturer Council','https://www.waventurers.com.au/'],['Scouts WA events','The state events calendar for every section','https://scoutswa.com.au/events/list'],['Program Resources','Badge, milestone and program material','https://resources.scouts.com.au/portal/en/home'],['ScoutMap','Register, update details, pay and book events','https://scoutswa.com.au/scoutmap/'],['Terrain','Youth and adult progress tracking and logbooks','http://terrain.scouts.com.au'],['Scout Central','Member login hub for Scouts Australia','https://central.scouts.com.au/'],['Scout Cloud','Online storage and tools for members','https://scoutcloud.scouts.com.au/'],['Scout Shop','Uniforms, badges and equipment','https://scoutshop.com.au/'],['Training','Training for leaders and adult volunteers','http://training.scouts.com.au/'],['Child Safe Scouting','How Scouts keeps young people safe','https://scouts.com.au/child-safe/'],['Scouts Australia FAQ','Answers about joining, safety and volunteering','https://scouts.com.au/faq/']];
